</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Sensitive detection of pathological prion protein by cyclic amplification of protein misfolding.</article-title><source>Nature</source><volume>411</volume><fpage>810</fpage><lpage>813</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11459061</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000435-Saa1"><label>46</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Saa</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Castilla</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Soto</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Ultra-efficient replication of infectious prions by automated protein misfolding cyclic amplification.</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><volume>281</volume><fpage>35245</fpage><lpage>35252</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16982620</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000435-Cindy1"><label>47</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cindy</surname><given-names>MCooke</given-names></name><name><surname>Joanne</surname><given-names>Rodger</given-names></name><name><surname>Allister</surname><given-names>Smith</given-names></name><name><surname>Karen</surname><given-names>Fernie</given-names></name><name><surname>George</surname><given-names>Shaw</given-names></name><name><surname>Robert</surname><given-names>ASomerville</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Fate of Prions in Soil: Detergent Extraction of PrP from SoilsEnviron.</article-title><source>Sci. Technol.</source><volume>41</volume><fpage>811</fpage><lpage>817</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000435-Hatzinger1"><label>48</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hatzinger</surname><given-names>PB</given-names></name><name><surname>Alexander</surname><given-names